      <li>Kolsky, H. (1963). <i>Stress Waves in Solids</i>. Dover.</li>
      <li>Chen, W. W., and Song, B. (2011). <i>Split Hopkinson (Kolsky) Bar: Design, Testing and Applications</i>. Springer.</li>
      <li>Lifshitz, J. M., and Leber, H. (1994). Data processing in the split Hopkinson pressure bar tests. <i>International Journal of Impact Engineering</i>, 15(6), 723–733.</li>
